 ear. As the madness spreads, the inhabitants of Kurouzu-cho are pulled ever deeper, as if into a whirlpool from which there is no return...\n\n\n\n(Source: VIZ Media)"],"ja":["うずまき",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-62824":"2026-01-09T05:36:44Z","serial-61912":"2024-10-21T12:17:22Z","serial-63067":"2025-03-30T15:12:01Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-62824","serial-61912","serial-63067"],"relatedMalIds":[],"rating":5.66}]}